00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:12.060
Things can hit you and hurt you and the game isn't necessarily easy, but it's also like the game isn't about being a traditional like action game where you're just fighting enemies and getting to the end of a stage.

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:19.260
